<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Tabuk Agri 1996 net profit sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Saudi Tabuk Agri 1996 net profit sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit	     12.77    vs    2.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 15.39    vs    5.83</p>
<p> Sales		   129.13    vs  102.70</p>
<p> Total dividends	10.00    vs    same</p>
<p> Assets		  139.80    vs  152.63</p>
<p>Full Name: Tabuk Agricultural Development Company.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
